# Line-ending discipline: LF in the repository and the working tree,
# Windows scripts keep CRLF (cmd parsers). This kills the per-commit
# LF/CRLF warning noise that once buried a real anomaly (build-rel/ staged
# artifacts, 2026-10-14) and steadies file-state tracking for tooling.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
